{
 "id": "seg5b",
 "title": "今天能做什么",
 "pill": 5,
 "total": 61.7,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5b-00",
   "text": "最后，每个人今天就能做一件事。",
   "spoken": "最后，每个人今天就能做一件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5b-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.264,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 4.031
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-01",
   "text": "写合约的人，找出每一处除法，写下余数归谁。",
   "spoken": "写合约的人，找出每一处除法，写下余数归谁。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5b-01.mp3",
   "start": 5.084,
   "dur": 4.776,
   "speechStart": 5.182,
   "speechEnd": 9.039
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-02",
   "text": "审计的人，逐个检查 unchecked 块，类型转换，内联汇编和移位。",
   "spoken": "审计的人，逐个检查 unchecked 块，类型转换，内联汇编和移位。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5b-02.mp3",
   "start": 10.08,
   "dur": 6.216,
   "speechStart": 10.178,
   "speechEnd": 15.451
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-03",
   "text": "做测试的人，把同一操作重复 1000 次，看误差流向谁。",
   "spoken": "做测试的人，把同一操作虫复 1000 次，看误差流向谁。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5b-03.mp3",
   "start": 16.516,
   "dur": 4.992,
   "speechStart": 16.614,
   "speechEnd": 20.685
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-04",
   "text": "普通用户，别当新金库的第一个存款人。",
   "spoken": "普通用户，别当新金库的第一个存款人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5b-04.mp3",
   "start": 21.728,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 21.826,
   "speechEnd": 24.957
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-05",
   "text": "存入后马上核对份额。是 0 或明显偏少，立刻停下。",
   "spoken": "存入后马上核对份额。是 0 或明显偏少，立刻停下。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5b-05.mp3",
   "start": 26.028,
   "dur": 5.928,
   "speechStart": 26.126,
   "speechEnd": 31.111
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-06",
   "text": "跨链转账时，核对同一代币在两条链上的精度。",
   "spoken": "跨链转账时，核对同一代币在两条链上的精度。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5b-06.mp3",
   "start": 32.176,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 32.274,
   "speechEnd": 36.131
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-07",
   "text": "回到开头的问题。只错一点点的取整，怎么变成约 9480 万美元的损失？",
   "spoken": "回到开头的问题。只错一点点的取整，怎么变成约 9480 万美元的损失？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5b-07.mp3",
   "start": 37.196,
   "dur": 6.96,
   "speechStart": 37.294,
   "speechEnd": 43.315
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-08",
   "text": "因为余数给错了人，而且这一步，能在一笔交易里重复很多次。",
   "spoken": "因为余数给错了人，而且这一步，能在一笔交易里虫复很多次。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5b-08.mp3",
   "start": 44.656,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 44.754,
   "speechEnd": 49.575
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-09",
   "text": "反过来，只要余数始终归协议，重复多少次，也抠不出钱。",
   "spoken": "反过来，只要余数始终归协议，虫复多少次，也抠不出钱。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5b-09.mp3",
   "start": 50.636,
   "dur": 5.976,
   "speechStart": 50.734,
   "speechEnd": 55.793
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5b-10",
   "text": "下一集讲外部调用与代币兼容性。",
